  era: "Section 31 \xB7 Independent India \xB7 1947 \u2013 present"
  title: Five-Year Plans
  text: Planning began with the First Five-Year Plan in 1951, focused on agriculture; the Second, from 1956, based on the Mahalanobis model, stressed heavy industry. The Planning Commission was replaced by NITI Aayog in 2015.
